{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Plant, nurture, and build smart production chains!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fields of Fortune, you decide how you want to play. Relaxed and hands-on, or step by step through automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through quest lines with short dialogues directly in the game, you\u2019ll learn about new tools, machines, and systems, without time pressure and without complicated tutorials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gently automated, if you want.<br>Fully relaxed, when you need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/761a5f437177bfef7f0c791eb2cf5792.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/761a5f437177bfef7f0c791eb2cf5792.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/761a5f437177bfef7f0c791eb2cf5792.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Automation you truly understand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation is a core part of Fields of Fortune,<br>but it\u2019s introduced gradually and in a playful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with simple processes and learn step by step:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts for automatic transport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splitters for precise distribution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines to process your resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many systems are unlocked and explained through quests, directly in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4ac443120fa3a778fb2124aa7d9e741c.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4ac443120fa3a778fb2124aa7d9e741c.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4ac443120fa3a778fb2124aa7d9e741c.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Professional logging, fully automated</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little harvest bot takes care of the work:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cuts down trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plants new saplings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >automatically transports logs onward</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Via conveyor belts, the logs are delivered straight to the sawmill, where they are processed into lumber fully automatically.<br>Neat, sustainable, and surprisingly cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4378d562ee79c59c2ae2fa0501c41aaa.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4378d562ee79c59c2ae2fa0501c41aaa.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4378d562ee79c59c2ae2fa0501c41aaa.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f From idea to production chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts small grows with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine conveyor belts, splitters, and machines into large, fully automated production chains that process multiple resources at once and keep your farm supplied long-term.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your layouts, optimize routes, and watch an idea turn into a working system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5b2523ca638c3f88510b3c1b7c3348ac.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5b2523ca638c3f88510b3c1b7c3348ac.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5b2523ca638c3f88510b3c1b7c3348ac.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f The Academy to deepen your knowledge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you unlock the Academy. Here you can gradually learn all four disciplines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Animal Care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2697\ufe0f Alchemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Herbs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each specialization unlocks new buildings, recipes, and possibilities.<br>Within each discipline, however, you make conscious talent choices, allowing you to shape your playstyle individually without missing out on content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/316187360b4504c7f7130b2eaecf2d12.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/316187360b4504c7f7130b2eaecf2d12.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/316187360b4504c7f7130b2eaecf2d12.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea4 Set sail and discover new islands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail to procedurally generated islands full of surprises. Discover new plants and herbs, encounter strange animals, and find hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you collect can be brought back home. Who knows what the next island holds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Your own paradise, the way you want it</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start small, with a few tools and a big idea. You freely place fields and buildings, developing your land piece by piece, by hand or through automation. In town, you can trade, take on tasks, and earn rewards. Animals are also part of your farm. You take care of food, water, and enclosures, and collect what they provide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed or optimized, you decide how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/862c95f59b8c55a8d9c351f8ea31c8a5.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/862c95f59b8c55a8d9c351f8ea31c8a5.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/862c95f59b8c55a8d9c351f8ea31c8a5.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Features at a glance</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Calm pixel world focused on farming, crafting &amp; animal care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Deep, guided automation with conveyor belts &amp; machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Professions &amp; specializations through the Academy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Large production chains from small to complex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Procedurally generated islands with new resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 seasonal events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f No combat, no time pressure. Play at your own pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50 </strong>Now in Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields of Fortune is now available in Early Access. Play it now and help shape the game with your feedback.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wheat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/2828f8e669b95133e02b5a04a5b9740688b556c1.jpg"},{"name":"Wheat II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/4d330e841a01385f0572717a46daf03d8f4887c7.jpg"},{"name":"Builder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/33b164a0c3799ec923f42dfb98116e33b9f375c4.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/89e050637f06479bf79c726607b4c8c3b9d7958d.jpg"},{"name":"More Storage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/2001130956548205e10d6f7d7ad8f9bc5d0ed897.jpg"},{"name":"Corn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/2bc3ab08dc588ea05c150050a373168a177756ce.jpg"},{"name":"Corn II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/476f768c67a2e01752eb88339c281e7984dc54ab.jpg"},{"name":"Sugarcane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/5da46545a612599e05b1ab3288350c627d5ec9b0.jpg"},{"name":"Sugarcane II","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/44d1c150d6f57cf37c23a58ee8668bdef694cc0a.jpg"},{"name":"Tomatoes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649980/19ba7c92ae7622ed5b983c863e82718c60809625.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649980?t=1773936988","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/55edf5f87fcaed17e02aef0869512593fa732f55/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773936988","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/5455594df9a9f3e81b67b942ebe1b6c370983856/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773936988","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/5455594df9a9f3e81b67b942ebe1b6c370983856/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773936988","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf31 Plant, nurture, and build smart production chains!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Fields of Fortune, you decide how you want to play. Relaxed and hands-on, or step by step through automation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through quest lines with short dialogues directly in the game, you\u2019ll learn about new tools, machines, and systems, without time pressure and without complicated tutorials.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gently automated, if you want.<br>Fully relaxed, when you need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/761a5f437177bfef7f0c791eb2cf5792.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/761a5f437177bfef7f0c791eb2cf5792.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/761a5f437177bfef7f0c791eb2cf5792.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Automation you truly understand</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automation is a core part of Fields of Fortune,<br>but it\u2019s introduced gradually and in a playful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with simple processes and learn step by step:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conveyor belts for automatic transport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splitters for precise distribution</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Machines to process your resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many systems are unlocked and explained through quests, directly in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4ac443120fa3a778fb2124aa7d9e741c.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4ac443120fa3a778fb2124aa7d9e741c.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4ac443120fa3a778fb2124aa7d9e741c.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\ude93 Professional logging, fully automated</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your little harvest bot takes care of the work:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cuts down trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >plants new saplings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >automatically transports logs onward</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Via conveyor belts, the logs are delivered straight to the sawmill, where they are processed into lumber fully automatically.<br>Neat, sustainable, and surprisingly cute.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4378d562ee79c59c2ae2fa0501c41aaa.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4378d562ee79c59c2ae2fa0501c41aaa.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/4378d562ee79c59c2ae2fa0501c41aaa.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f From idea to production chain</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts small grows with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine conveyor belts, splitters, and machines into large, fully automated production chains that process multiple resources at once and keep your farm supplied long-term.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your layouts, optimize routes, and watch an idea turn into a working system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5b2523ca638c3f88510b3c1b7c3348ac.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5b2523ca638c3f88510b3c1b7c3348ac.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/5b2523ca638c3f88510b3c1b7c3348ac.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f The Academy to deepen your knowledge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the game, you unlock the Academy. Here you can gradually learn all four disciplines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Animal Care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf31 Plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2697\ufe0f Alchemy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f Herbs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each specialization unlocks new buildings, recipes, and possibilities.<br>Within each discipline, however, you make conscious talent choices, allowing you to shape your playstyle individually without missing out on content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/316187360b4504c7f7130b2eaecf2d12.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/316187360b4504c7f7130b2eaecf2d12.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/316187360b4504c7f7130b2eaecf2d12.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea4 Set sail and discover new islands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail to procedurally generated islands full of surprises. Discover new plants and herbs, encounter strange animals, and find hidden treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you collect can be brought back home. Who knows what the next island holds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/e1d8123d9798d57f644aed8961935aa6.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Your own paradise, the way you want it</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start small, with a few tools and a big idea. You freely place fields and buildings, developing your land piece by piece, by hand or through automation. In town, you can trade, take on tasks, and earn rewards. Animals are also part of your farm. You take care of food, water, and enclosures, and collect what they provide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxed or optimized, you decide how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/862c95f59b8c55a8d9c351f8ea31c8a5.poster.avif?t=1773936988\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/862c95f59b8c55a8d9c351f8ea31c8a5.webm?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/extras/862c95f59b8c55a8d9c351f8ea31c8a5.mp4?t=1773936988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Features at a glance</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e Calm pixel world focused on farming, crafting &amp; animal care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Deep, guided automation with conveyor belts &amp; machines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Professions &amp; specializations through the Academy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Large production chains from small to complex</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f Procedurally generated islands with new resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 seasonal events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a\ufe0f No combat, no time pressure. Play at your own pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b50 </strong>Now in Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fields of Fortune is now available in Early Access. Play it now and help shape the game with your feedback.</p>","developers":["UC Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649980/d58c2c2ddcd53de3c2bc149fa1cf0ab8c3606370/header.jpg?t=1773936988","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649980/626782546/56da66204f68a232b7eec75424d6c305403165d4/1771839337/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771840744","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649980/626782546/56da66204f68a232b7eec75424d6c305403165d4/1771839337/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771840744","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3649980/626782546/56da66204f68a232b7eec75424d6c305403165d4/1771839337/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771840744","id":257292668,"name":"Steam Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta